Objective: Store gold in storage

Move your surveyor around your complex until you locate gold deposits.  Use your constructor to build a mine positioned above the spot with gold.  Have your engineers build a gold vault, a new power generator, and connectors that connect all the new structures to the rest.

Use your tanks and scouts to defend your construction site. Mission ends when your new mining station transfers at least 1 unit of unrefined gold into storage vault.

